# API Contracts

Web talks to Nest via HTTP only. No Prisma in web.

## Response envelope

`ResponseTransformInterceptor` wraps success responses:

```ts
{ success: true, message: "OK", data: T, errors: null, timestamp, path, statusCode }
```

Exceptions via `GlobalExceptionFilter`:

```ts
{ success: false, message, data: null, errors?: string[], timestamp, path, statusCode }
```

Exceptions: `/metrics` (plain text), `StreamableFile` downloads.

## Pagination (offset)

Request: `PaginationQueryDto` — `page`, `limit` (1–100), `sortBy`, `sortOrder`, `search`.

Response (`PaginatedResult`):

```ts
{ items: T[], meta: { total, page, limit, totalPages } }
```

## Pagination (cursor)

Some endpoints (e.g. surveys with `cursorPagination=true`):

```ts
{ items: T[], meta: { limit, nextCursor: string | null } }
```

Do not mix cursor and offset shapes in the same endpoint.

## DTOs (API)

- `class-validator` + `@ApiProperty` for Swagger.
- Query numbers: `@Type(() => Number)` + `@IsInt`.
- Prisma enums: `@IsEnum(...)`.

## Web client

- `lib/api/client.ts` — unwraps `data`, throws on `!success`.
- `getApiErrorMessage()` — prefer `errors[]` over generic "Validation failed".
- RSC server fetch: `unwrapApiProfile()` for `/users/me`.

## Shared validation

- Prefer `@workspace/validation` Zod schemas for domain rules used on both sides.
- Do not invent parallel request shapes in web types when API DTO exists in `lib/api/types.ts`.

## HTTP status mapping

| Case                     | Status                    |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------- |
| DTO validation           | 400                       |
| Missing/invalid JWT      | 401                       |
| Permission/tenant denied | 403                       |
| Not found                | 404                       |
| Prisma P2002             | 409                       |
| Throttle                 | 429                       |
| Unhandled                | 500 (no internal details) |
